The I Ching is a kind of cryptic oracular inscription that you're supposed to decipher, and it was heavily used in divination in early China.
The numerical symbols, or values, are actually tied to a semi-mythical figure by the name of Fu Xi... who is perhaps the earliest legendary ruler of China.
