NARRATOR: 
Nazca.
The Ica region of Peru.
High in this arid desert, there is a series of precise geoglyphic formations that have mystified people since their modern discovery in the 1920s.
They are called the Nazca Lines.
These geoglyphs appear in many shapes and sizes.
Some are figures of animals.
Others are plants.
And a few even appear to be depicting humans or human-like beings.
And all of them were made on a scale to be seen from above.
